{
  "info": {
    "name": "Project Management API",
    "description": "REST API untuk aplikasi Project Management (Laravel 12 + Sanctum + PostgreSQL).\n\nBase URL diatur via variable `{{base_url}}` (default: http://localhost:8000/api).\n\n**Cara pakai:**\n1. Import collection ini ke Postman\n2. Import environment `project-management-local.postman_environment.json` (optional)\n3. Jalankan request `Auth > Login (Admin)` - token otomatis tersimpan ke variable `{{token}}`\n4. Endpoint authenticated lainnya otomatis pakai token dari variable\n\n**Akun demo:**\n- admin@test.com / admin123 (ADMIN) - full access\n- pm@test.com / pm123456 (PROJECT_MANAGER) - semua kecuali manage user\n- member@test.com / member123 (TEAM_MEMBER) - read + update status task + comment\n- client@test.com / client123 (CLIENT) - read-only\n\n**Authorization matrix:**\n| Aksi | Admin | PM | Member | Client |\n|---|:-:|:-:|:-:|:-:|\n| Read semua | YES | YES | YES | YES |\n| Project CRUD | YES | YES | - | - |\n| Task CRUD | YES | YES | - | - |\n| Task status update | YES | YES | YES | - |\n| Comment | YES | YES | YES | - |\n| User CRUD | YES | - | - | - |",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:8000/api",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "project_id",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "task_id",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "user_id",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "comment_id",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "notification_id",
      "value": "1",
      "type": "string"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login (Admin)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (json.data && json.data.token) {",
                  "        const token = json.data.token;",
                  "        // Set ke environment kalau ada environment aktif",
                  "        if (pm.environment.name) {",
                  "            pm.environment.set('token', token);",
                  "            console.log('Token saved to ENV:', pm.environment.name, '->', token.substring(0, 30) + '...');",
                  "        }",
                  "        // Set juga ke collection variable (fallback)",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('token', token);",
                  "        console.log('Token saved to COLLECTION ->', token.substring(0, 30) + '...');",
                  "    }",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"admin@test.com\",\n  \"password\": \"admin123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/login",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["login"]
            }
          }
        },
